      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "For your online shop in Lyon, the core GDPR principles to focus on are lawfulness, purpose limitation, and data minimization. This means you must have a clear legal basis (like contract fulfillment) to collect names, emails, and addresses, and you should only collect what is strictly necessary for processing the order. Always be transparent by providing a privacy policy detailing how you use and protect this data.",
