      "content": "ok that makes sense. you mentioned \"hidden vulnerabilities\" though. it's just a bit unnerving thinking about things lurking in your system that you don't even know are there. are there specific signs i should look for that might indicate something sneaky or unauthorized is happening with my customer data?",
